{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22419","headline":"赠别崔五 · 白居易","name":"赠别崔五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝送南去客，暮迎北来宾。\n孰云当大路，少遇心所亲。\n劳者念息肩，热者思濯身。\n何如愁独日，忽见平生人。\n平生已不浅，是日重殷勤。\n问从何处来，及此江亭春。\n江天春多阴，夜月隔重云。\n移尊树间饮，灯照花纷纷。\n一会不易得，余事何足云。\n明旦又分手，今夕且欢忻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22419.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22419","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}